              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "How does Telugu make \"you\" respectful, and which languages share the trick? (By the plural — mīru; Tamil nīṅgaḷ, Kannada nīvu, French vous.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
